Create a transparent-background SPRITE ATLAS with EXACTLY twelve separate occult power sigils, matching the delicate organic ivory-gold symbol language in the bottom power bar of the supplied game screenshot. Atlas grid EXACTLY four columns and three rows, no text/labels/numbers. Overall approx1536x1152, eachcell384square; center one symbol in eachcell, outerdiameter270px leaving57px empty margin. Consistent scale. Thin broken antique-gold circular rim with sparse tiny ticks, inner glyph visually dominant; offwhite-gold solid organic shapes mixed with hairline filigree and negative space. No thick gold coin medallions, no embossed buttons, no shiny logo badges, no opaque backplate. A few wornedge glints and subtly warm shading give original painterly material. This should look like the reference's distinctive hand-drawn eldritch icon family, not generic fantasy UI vector icons.
Grid order left-to-right, top-to-bottom:
1 LISTEN: asymmetric all-seeing eye with three gently curled eyelid arcs;
2 DREAM: two interlocking flowing crescent-spirals;
3 ORACLE: three small hollow open mouths in a growing branching curl;
4 BESTOW: elongated teardrop/flame enclosed by two blade-leaf forms;
5 APPOINT: branching crown with three small elevated flames and central vertical mark;
6 SACRIFICE: upturned shallow chalice, branching flame rising from it;
7 BREACH: dark negative-space crescent portal edged by delicate dots;
8 SEED: symmetrical rooted tree with two drooping seed pods;
9 ANCHOR: pointed double hook with long vertical central stem;
10 VEIL: fine hood-like curved arch enclosing a dark slit and little dot;
11 TRANSFER: two doorway arches connected by an organic curved bridge;
12 MANIFEST: radiating broken sun/eye/star with long vertical pupil.
All12 distinct, exactly12cells, no duplication. Each glyph fits safely within itscell with real transparent space between. No captions, no gridlines, no checkerboard. Legible at36px in the finished game. Only the12sigils, no whole-screen game image.
